# [PROJECT_NAME] Constitution

> Spec-Kit format (v0.10.x). This file is a STRUCTURAL GUIDE for an LLM.
> Generate REAL principles derived from the project context. Lives at
> `.specify/memory/constitution.md` and is the source of truth for the
> Constitution Check gate in plan.md.
>
> Principles MUST be non-negotiable, declarative, and TESTABLE — each one must
> be phrased so a reviewer can objectively verify a plan or PR complies. Avoid
> vague aspirations. If a value the constitution needs (e.g., the ratification
> date) is not given in the context, use `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION: <question>]`
> or fall back to today's date for first ratification.

